; Constants and types declared in classes and advanced records: unknown
; members, a constant used as a type, a type used as a value, strict
; private access, forward classes that are never defined, redefinitions,
; nested names outside their class, and what is not supported yet.
; RUN: not %pcc --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/nested/errors.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: errors.pas:11:10: error: interfaces cannot be declared in a class or record yet
; CHECK: errors.pas:13:11: error: redefinition of 'Cap'
; CHECK: errors.pas:8:11: note: previous definition is here
; CHECK: errors.pas:10:10: error: class 'TFwd' is declared forward but never defined
; CHECK: errors.pas:20:13: error: no member named 'TNope' in class 'TOuter'
; CHECK: errors.pas:21:13: error: 'Cap' is a constant, not a type
; CHECK: errors.pas:22:6: error: unknown type name 'TInner'
; CHECK: errors.pas:24:11: error: no member named 'TNone' in record 'TRec'
; CHECK: errors.pas:26:18: error: no member named 'TNope' in class 'TOuter'
; CHECK: errors.pas:28:15: error: 'Secret' is a strict private member of 'TOuter'
; CHECK: errors.pas:29:15: error: 'TList' is a type, not a value
; CHECK: errors.pas:31:15: error: no member named 'Missing' in class 'TOuter'
; CHECK: errors.pas:32:15: error: typecasts through a qualified type name are not supported yet; declare a type alias for 'TList'
; CHECK: errors.pas:33:15: error: 'Cap' is a constant, not a method
; CHECK-NOT: error:

; RUN: not %pcc --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/nested/parse.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=PARSE %s
; PARSE: parse.pas:5:11: error: typed constants in records are not supported yet
; PARSE: parse.pas:12:3: error: expected constant name after 'const'
; PARSE-NOT: error:
